@startuml
!include theme.iuml
title Save project-scoped coursework; export only saved evidence as a DRAFT
hide footbox
autonumber
actor Member
participant "Coursework / CourseworkExport\n<<React functions>>" as Web
participant "coursework_api.py" as API
participant "coursework_store.py" as Profile
participant "workspace : WorkspaceStore" as Store
participant "coursework_export.py / coursework.py" as Export
participant "Deterministic compiler / source files" as Local

activate Member
Member -> Web : Save project profile / grammar / discussion
activate Web
Web -> API : PUT /api/coursework/project\nprofile + cookie/Origin/CSRF/project
activate API
note over API : Authenticated identity and both storage adapters are bound.
API -> Profile : save_project(profile)
activate Profile
Profile -> Local : analyze_grammar(profile.grammar)
activate Local
Local --> Profile : bounded valid grammar or GrammarError
deactivate Local
opt Grammar valid
  Profile -> Store : save_coursework(profile)
  activate Store
  note over Store : Upsert JSON at project_id under account lock;\nbump workspace version in the same transaction.
  Store --> Profile : committed or storage failure
  deactivate Store
end
Profile --> API : submitted profile or exception
deactivate Profile
API --> Web : saved snapshot / safe error
deactivate API
Web --> Member : mark submitted snapshot saved; preserve later edits/errors
deactivate Web

Member -> Web : Download coursework draft
activate Web
alt Unsaved profile / save or screenshot work pending
  note over Web : Finish explicit save/upload first; no export of unsaved editor state.
else Explicit eligible export
  Web -> API : GET /api/coursework/export\ncookie + selected project
  activate API
  API -> Export : export_bundle()
  activate Export
  Export -> Profile : load_project(); list_screenshots(); screenshot_bytes(id)
  activate Profile
  Profile -> Store : read selected-project profile and image bytes
  activate Store
  Store --> Profile : saved values / missing or storage error
  deactivate Store
  Profile --> Export : saved profile and genuine supplied screenshots
  deactivate Profile
  Export -> Store : read selected-project entries via dataset adapter
  activate Store
  Store --> Export : bounded corpus or error
  deactivate Store
  Export -> Local : analyze saved grammar/corpus; read selected source files
  activate Local
  Local --> Export : token/grammar/table/trace results and sources
  deactivate Local
  Export -> Export : build_report(); build_presentation(); assemble ZIP
  activate Export
  Export --> Export : DRAFT HTML / PPTX / CSV-JSON / images / source snapshots
  deactivate Export
  Export --> API : ZIP bytes or exception
  deactivate Export
  API --> Web : application/zip; no-store / safe error
  deactivate API
end
Web --> Member : download started or retained state + actionable error
deactivate Web
deactivate Member
legend bottom
  Export is not a single global snapshot transaction across all sequential reads.
  Real raw text and contributor metadata are private: review before sharing with course recipients.
  Raw recordings are not embedded here; full workspace backups retain recordings and coursework.
  Generated regression expectations replay current parser decisions, not an independent linguistic oracle.
  Missing research stays visible; 25 sections do not guarantee a 25-30-page final report.
endlegend
@enduml
